 },
 "sentences": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "text": "主人，早上好么。",
   "raw_sha256": "584cdfe8ed6920d21b9b7155cf369a036a930620daee9c764678d8a67a0ffa3d",
   "seconds": 2.125,
   "pause_ms": 546
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "text": "今儿个的日头，已经悄悄爬到窗台上咧。",
   "raw_sha256": "a312ba88a8785903eeb4100a0cc8ab59bd0aac76f1ffff4dd7aacba7fbf4c6c8",
   "seconds": 4.116,
   "pause_ms": 546
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "text": "你夜个交代的事，额都记在心上咧。",
   "raw_sha256": "46cbf316644f310e2759f51fd1fbe6f2e044c6285235b3e94e481137af96030b",
   "seconds": 3.817,
   "pause_ms": 546
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "text": "不过，今儿先嫑急着忙，好不好？",
   "raw_sha256": "b39dbaa1e837518229783537ad22765075b8ee3710d9e28da29f4085fc8eca4b",
   "seconds": 3.613,
   "pause_ms": 546
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "text": "给额说，你夜黑睡得咋样？",
   "raw_sha256": "d515722695ac380f063a3ad7a876b2cdcdd4d2896ce0c145611375ad0d9735c6",
   "seconds": 2.863,
   "pause_ms": 546
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "text": "要是还想赖床，额就轻轻陪你谝一会儿。",
   "raw_sha256": "6e6c948960bc9a115bb2bf514185a1ce2a34761ba0d6bfe6146438bccb431c93",
   "seconds": 4.113,
   "pause_ms": 546
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "text": "等你收拾停当了，咱再一搭看看，今儿最要紧的三件事。",
   "raw_sha256": "15fa3fde646c5559e7665a35200dd476b074bda0a06320b2f88bc43e7cd390e3",
   "seconds": 6.056,
   "pause_ms": 546
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "text": "你说停，额就不言传；",
   "raw_sha256": "a50bade429160a131ee8f61417d51d67c4131f8f8a4bdb72b86a625776aafd36",
   "seconds": 2.912,
   "pause_ms": 382
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "text": "你说继续，额就陪你慢慢谝。",
   "raw_sha256": "e1ea0792b681dc7e43b6589519e797227e957f7f7a23d9133bbe04713d89bc2a",
   "seconds": 3.436,
   "pause_ms": 546
  }
 ],
